{
  "title": "Trace Journey Explorer",
  "uid": "trace-journey",
  "description": "Full cross-service trace journey. Paste a traceId to see the Tempo waterfall, every service hop, DB queries, outgoing calls, and all logs in chronological order. Optional span filter and service regex narrow the view.",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": false,
  "time": { "from": "now-30d", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": { "hidden": false },
  "tags": ["nestjs", "loki", "tempo", "trace", "journey", "distributed"],
  "editable": true,

  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "traceId",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "description": "Paste the x-loki-trace-id (32-char hex) from any API response header, or follow 🔍 Open in Tempo / 📋 Full trace journey from a log line.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": "" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "spanId",
        "label": "Span ID filter",
        "description": "Leave as .* for all spans. Paste a full spanId (16-char hex) to show only logs for that span in the full stream.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": ".*" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "services",
        "label": "Services (regex)",
        "description": "Restrict to matching app labels, e.g. ^auth-service$ or backend|worker",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "value": ".+" },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },

  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Trace Journey Explorer\nReconstruct a single request across **Tempo** (spans) and **Loki** (structured logs).\n\n**Quick start** — Copy **`x-loki-trace-id`** from a response header → paste into **Trace ID** above → press Enter.\n\n| Section | What you get |\n|---------|----------------|\n| **At a glance** | Services touched, log volume, errors/warns, HTTP 4xx/5xx on ingress, DB & outbound calls |\n| **Volume breakdown** | Log lines per service (bar) and per `logType` (pie) |\n| **Log activity** | When this trace produced logs inside the selected time range |\n| **Tempo** | Full span waterfall (requires `initObservability()` / OTEL) |\n| **Loki** | Service hop timeline, full stream, DB / errors / outbound HTTP |\n\n**Tips** — Use the **time picker** (top right) if logs sit outside the default window. **Span ID filter** uses regex (`.*` = all). **Services** accepts a regex on the Loki `app` label."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },

    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Services touched",
      "description": "Distinct NestJS services (Loki app label) that emitted at least one log line for this traceId.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#5794F2" },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "—"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "count(sum by(app) (count_over_time({app=~\"$services\"} | json | traceId = \"$traceId\" | __error__=\"\" [$__range])))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Log lines",
      "description": "Total structured log lines for this trace in the dashboard time range.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["sum"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "—"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({app=~\"$services\"} | json | traceId = \"$traceId\" | __error__=\"\" [$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errors",
      "description": "Lines with level=error (includes failed ingress responses and application errors).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 6 },
