      "title": "Tempo trace waterfall",
      "description": "Full span tree when traces are exported to Tempo (initObservability / OpenTelemetry). Empty here usually means no trace for this ID in Tempo yet — rely on Loki sections below. Click spans to correlate with logs when traces are linked.",
